            <section>
               <title value="Hospital course note"/>
               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you regarding our mutual patient, a 61-year-old male admitted on 06/04/2017 with symptomatic aortic valve stenosis. Upon admission, echocardiographic assessment confirmed severe aortic stenosis with significantly reduced valve area and elevated mean transvalvular gradient. Coronary angiography was performed to exclude concomitant coronary artery disease. Following multidisciplinary Heart Team discussion, the patient was deemed suitable for transcatheter aortic valve implantation (TAVI) given his clinical profile. The procedure was performed successfully on 06/04/2017 via transfemoral access without periprocedural complications. Post-interventional echocardiography demonstrated excellent prosthetic valve function with no significant residual gradient. The patient recovered well and was discharged on 07/04/2017 in stable condition. Dual antiplatelet therapy has been initiated. Please arrange follow-up echocardiography in three months. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
